{
  "title": "Protect your hearing",
  "date": "12-20",
  "text": "If you love bringing your music to the gym, on your commute, or just using them to tune out the world when you need some personal time, chances are you've given earbuds a shot. However, despite their widespread use and convenience, earbud-style headphones aren't that great for your ears. Since you have to place them directly in your ear canal, your favorite beats are up close and personal with your eardrums — putting you at risk for discomfort, headaches, and even hearing loss. However, there's a better way to get the quality sound you crave without the risks of earbuds. The True Wireless Bone Conduction Earphones have quality audio without the discomfort of standard earbuds.",
